# 43. The most important teaching trick

Throughout the class, keep asking:

### Browser

> “Who provides this?”

```js
document
```

Answer:

> Browser.

Then:

```js
window
```

Browser.

Then:

```js
localStorage
```

Browser.

Then move to Node:

```js
process
```

Node.

```js
fs
```

Node.

```js
http
```

Node.

This repeatedly reinforces:

> **JavaScript is the language. The runtime provides capabilities.**

That one idea will make later concepts like:

```text
Node
Express
Deno
Bun
Next.js
Web APIs
React
Server Components
```

much easier for them to understand.

